<p><strong>Bottom line:</strong> If you are new to hydroponics, plant basil and mint first. They are the easiest. They grow fast. They forgive mistakes. Start with a $15 mason jar setup and a $40 grow light. Add chives week 2. Add the rest as you get confident. <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=hydroponic+starter+kit+for+beginners&tag=tabletopharve-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">Check current prices on Amazon</a>. The starter kit was around $25 when I last checked, but prices bounce between $20 and $30. Under $25 is a solid deal.</p>

